{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/12/3235163/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかなう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生姜はちみつレモン飲みながら\nブログ書いてる。なう\nからだぽかぽかしてきたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生姜入れ過ぎた。顔の毛穴が\n開いてきたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/12/3235163/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うおおおおおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の朝はスムージーを作りました。\n豆乳青汁バナナりんご\nヨーグルトきなこはちみつ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるもの適当にポイポイって入れて\nぐっしゃーと混ぜたら、\n普通においしくできた。\n料理せず、ミキサーに頼る女\nに、ならないように気をつけます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/12/3235163/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はお魚をちゃんと食べようと\n思って鮭にはまってます。\nというか鮭すきだ。\nもう鮭がかわいく思えてきた←ぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、かわいいブローチ集めに\nはまってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが今はまってるもの\n教えてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/12/3235163/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/12/3235163/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難波さんに推しメンとかいるのー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/12/3235163/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなかわいい..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/12/3235163/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"推しメン決められない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/12/3235163/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかの柔軟性はどんな感じなん？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/12/3235163/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレエやめたら\nすぐ硬くなっちゃって...\n前にできたことができなくなった。\nストレッチしなきゃー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/12/3235163/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩こりの心配\nありがとうございました...\nメンバー同士で\nマッサージやってます。\nみんなマッサージ上手！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/12/3235163/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジロリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪はこのぐらいボサボサでいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}